<title>USA: Sprint PCS launches service in Twin Cities.</title>
<headline>Sprint PCS launches service in Twin Cities.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sprint PCS said Wednesday it launched its personal communications services (PCS) in St. Paul and Minneapolis, Minnesota.</p>
<p>The Twin Cities brings the total number of cities with Sprint PCS service to 48.</p>
<p>Sprint PCS is a partnership of Sprint Corp, Tele-Communications Inc, Cox Communications Inc and Comcast Corp.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
